models/beatnet.onnx is the app's own beat model, under the app's license. It was
trained on:
  - the Ballroom dataset (Gouyon et al., ISMIR 2004) with the beat and bar
    annotations of Krebs et al. (github.com/CPJKU/BallroomAnnotations)
  - the Extended Ballroom dataset (Marchand & Peeters, ISMIR 2016), with beats and
    bar starts labelled by the Beat This! model at each clip's given tempo
  - the Hainsworth, Beatles and RWC spectrograms of the Beat This! collection
    (zenodo.org/records/13922116, CC BY 4.0) with their annotations
    (github.com/CPJKU/beat_this_annotations, MIT)
